upstream-build-fixes.patch - 2026-08-12

Temporary build fixes for diegosouzapw/OmniRoute release/v3.8.50 (tip 7ca7369),
whose default branch currently does not compile (upstream issue #9985).

Contents:
- Everything from upstream PR #10108 "fix(build): unblock standalone production
  build" (applied verbatim): gateways.ts brace closure, modelSelectModalHelpers.ts
  missing brace, videoGeneration.ts duplicate import, conol-web + deepai registry
  import fixes, tinycmsSigner.ts webpackIgnore for the wasm URL, conolDiscovery.ts
  import path, removal of the colliding migration 143_job_registry.sql.
- One additional hunk not covered by #10108: src/app/api/v1/models/catalog.ts
  stops re-exporting __setCatalogStaleWhileRevalidateAccessorForTest and
  __setCatalogStaleWhileRevalidateMsForTest, which catalogCache.ts no longer
  exports (matches the approach in upstream's fix branches).

Remove this file and the "Apply upstream build fixes" workflow step once upstream
merges their fixes (PRs #10108 / #10102 / #10131 / #10094 / #10140). The workflow
step warns and continues when this patch stops applying cleanly.

